<title>POLAND: Amerbank Q2 net rises to PLN 2.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Amerbank Q2 net rises to PLN 2.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amerbank preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					     Q2 1997     Q2 1996</p>
<p>    profit on banking operations    15.65    vs   9.91</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 5.40    vs   3.81</p>
<p>    net profit			     2.92    vs   1.95</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Amerykanski w Polsce Amerbank SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   21.16    vs  12.27</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	11.30    vs   6.56</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   4.15    vs   2.67</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  0.97    vs   0.31</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.48    vs   1.85</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>						H1 1997     H1 1996</p>
<p>    profit on banking operations    28.34    vs  18.88</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 9.22    vs   6.51</p>
<p>    net profit			     5.27    vs   3.60</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   37.54    vs  24.21</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	19.41    vs  13.03</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   7.28    vs   5.01</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  1.47    vs   0.54</p>
<p>    income tax			     3.96    vs   2.92</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
